    "exit": 0,
    "stdout": "Build projects from shared layers\n\nUsage: hydragen [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  init  Initialise a layer in the current directory\n  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\n\nOptions:\n      --non-interactive  Never prompt, even in a terminal\n  -h, --help             Print help\n  -V, --version          Print version\n",
